{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"亚里士多德·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"aristotle","categoryLabel":"亚里士多德","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/23_aristotle/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"亚里士多德-核心贡献\">亚里士多德·核心贡献</h1><p>亚里士多德对人类知识最划时代的贡献，是<strong>奠基性</strong>与<strong>百科全书式</strong>的：他创立了逻辑学这门学科（以三段论与《工具论》奠定西方形式逻辑的基础），以一套统一的研究范式对当时几乎所有知识进行系统整理与分类，并亲手开创或奠基了生物学、伦理学、政治学等众多学科。本部分要回答的核心问题是：<strong>他到底&quot;贡献&quot;了什么？凭什么方法做到？这些贡献的边界与代价又在哪里？</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-分工边界\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub：分工边界</h2><p>亚里士多德这个人物下有六个并列 hub，本 hub（核心贡献）专注于<strong>他作为&quot;学科奠基者&quot;的成就清单与方法</strong>——侧重&quot;他开创了哪些学科、用什么方式开创&quot;。要避免与兄弟 hub 重复，请按下表各取所需：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>想了解</th>\n<th>去这个 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生平、师承、吕克昂学园</td>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>具体哲学思想（四因、实体、中道、潜能现实）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每部著作的内容详解</td>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对后世（中世纪、伊斯兰、科学）的影响</td>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他的错误、争议、奴隶制女性问题</td>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键分工</strong>：本 hub 讲&quot;他奠基了伦理学这门<strong>学科</strong>（及其经验方法）&quot;，而&quot;中道&quot;&quot;幸福&quot;这些<strong>思想内容</strong>在 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 里展开；本 hub 讲&quot;他写了《工具论》这套<strong>逻辑体系</strong>&quot;，而《尼各马可伦理学》等单部书的逐篇解读在 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a> 里。本 hub 提及但不回护他的错误，详细批评交给 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节与推荐学习路径\">章节与推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 有三章，<strong>建议按序阅读</strong>——它呈现一条从&quot;思维工具&quot;到&quot;知识地图&quot;再到&quot;具体学科&quot;的递进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"the-founder-of-logic/\">逻辑学的创立</a></strong> — <a href=\"the-founder-of-logic/the-syllogism\">三段论</a>（形式逻辑的内核：格与式、思维规律）→ <a href=\"the-founder-of-logic/the-organon\">《工具论》</a>（六部书的体系与&quot;逻辑是工具&quot;的定位）。<strong>先读这章</strong>：逻辑是亚里士多德用来做一切学问的工具。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"the-systematizer-of-knowledge/\">知识的体系化</a></strong> — <a href=\"the-systematizer-of-knowledge/the-encyclopedic-mind\">百科全书式的心智</a>（广度背后的统一方法与代价）→ <a href=\"the-systematizer-of-knowledge/the-classification-of-sciences\">科学的分类</a>（按目的三分知识：理论/实践/制作）。<strong>再读这章</strong>：看他如何给整片知识疆域画地图。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"founder-of-sciences/\">诸学科的奠基</a></strong> — <a href=\"founder-of-sciences/the-father-of-biology\">生物学之父</a>（经验观察 + 目的论）→ <a href=\"founder-of-sciences/ethics-and-politics-as-science\">伦理学与政治学</a>（实践科学的方法）。<strong>最后读这章</strong>：看前两章的工具与方法如何落地为具体学科。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置条件</strong>：无需哲学基础，但若先浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/twenty-years-at-the-academy/student-of-plato\">生平与时代·柏拉图的学生</a>，会更容易理解他&quot;注重经验、面向自然&quot;的品格从何而来（这是他区别于柏拉图的关键）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贯穿全-hub-的两条主线\">贯穿全 hub 的两条主线</h2><p>读完会发现，六篇文档反复回到两个主题：其一，<strong>统一的研究范式</strong>——无论研究推理、动物还是政制，亚里士多德都做同样四件事（收集→界定分类→探因→体系化）；其二，<strong>方法 vs 结论的区分</strong>——他的具体结论（地心说、奴隶制辩护）多被历史淘汰，但他的方法（经验观察、系统分类、形式化、按目的分科）历久弥新。看懂这两条主线，就抓住了亚里士多德为何被尊为&quot;第一位老师&quot;（the First Teacher）的根本。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-founder-of-logic","title":"The Founder Of Logic","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-founder-of-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-syllogism","title":"三段论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-founder-of-logic/the-syllogism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-organon","title":"《工具论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-founder-of-logic/the-organon"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-systematizer-of-knowledge","title":"The Systematizer Of Knowledge","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-systematizer-of-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-encyclopedic-mind","title":"百科全书式的心智","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-systematizer-of-knowledge/the-encyclopedic-mind"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-classification-of-sciences","title":"科学的分类","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-systematizer-of-knowledge/the-classification-of-sciences"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"founder-of-sciences","title":"Founder Of Sciences","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/founder-of-sciences","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-biology","title":"生物学之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/founder-of-sciences/the-father-of-biology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ethics-and-politics-as-science","title":"伦理学与政治学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/founder-of-sciences/ethics-and-politics-as-science"}]}]}